abstract: >-
  Quantum Runtime is the independent local AI runtime and model-service layer
  developed by Starlight Unit Studios. It provides the stable application-facing
  runtime boundary used by Ember CoreUI, other Starlight applications and later
  Quantum CoreOS.
keywords:
